stateDiagram-v2
    %% powerdown_ctrl (rtl/fub/powerdown_ctrl.sv)
    %% OPTIONAL block: live RTL, but NOT in the default top build.
    [*] --> S_AWAKE: reset (CKE high)

    S_AWAKE --> S_ARMING: request_enabled && controller_idle
    S_ARMING --> S_AWAKE: activity / modes disabled
    S_ARMING --> S_REQ: idle_cnt >= idle_threshold (latch kind SR else PDE)

    S_REQ --> S_AWAKE: activity / modes disabled
    S_REQ --> S_ASLEEP: pdn_grant (CKE low)

    S_ASLEEP --> S_AWAKE: any new activity<br/>(SR exit timing enforced by scheduler)

    note right of S_ARMING
      Counts idle cycles
      toward the entry threshold
    end note

    note right of S_REQ
      pdn_req high, awaiting grant
      kind = SR (self-refresh) over
      PDE (precharge power-down)
    end note

    note left of S_ASLEEP
      CKE dropped (dfi_cke=0)
      r_kind=1 -> SR (sref_active)
      r_kind=0 -> PDE
    end note
